  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empowering the collective Voice of Honduran Youth</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OYE will develop four additional programmatic areas to increase economic opportunities for youth and reduce risks, including the likelihood of high-risk migration, through the inclusion of income generating activities. New program areas include short term technical training, scholarships for students to complete their secondary school education, youth microenterprise training and development, (and institutional microenterprise initiatives to support the sustainability of the OYE scholarship program) and the establishment of a network of public, private and civil society organizations in the El Progreso area to promote youth employment opportunities in the formal labor force.</narrative>
  </description>
